{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/58836c6bfa46103355427bbd8c586735.poster.avif?t=1770058654\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/58836c6bfa46103355427bbd8c586735.webm?t=1770058654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/58836c6bfa46103355427bbd8c586735.mp4?t=1770058654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/3c075473fb4f0d14ac81606a8ecf87ec.avif?t=1770058654\" width=888 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A lone salvager awakens an ancient MARBL device whose buried memories hint that Rennova\u2019s faction wars have played out countless times before. With conflicted Mechommanders and a crew divided by ideology, you must uncover why the MARBL chose you and whether this cycle can finally break.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Robots: Unleashed</strong> is a competitive sci-fi card battler built inside a living starship. Fight fast 1v1 robot duels, unlock Mechommanders, explore your ship, and uncover a narrative shaped by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/94131f191b90827d3f6a75b9bde4c30a.avif?t=1770058654\" width=891 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge robots from HALT components (Head, Arms, Legs, Torso), assemble full warbots, and watch them clash in real-time cinematic combat. Every turn is a tight tactical puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3-health duel system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hybrid-color deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pay-to-win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked and unranked modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/6e5b2bfca168edb7bd590689ea1da8b7.avif?t=1770058654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras_big/6e5b2bfca168edb7bd590689ea1da8b7.webp?t=1770058654 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/48cd3b829a339207b663dee33889f8a0.avif?t=1770058654\" width=891 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between matches, explore the Slate, an evolving dropship that grows with your progress. Rooms unlock, characters react to you, and hidden terminals reveal the truth behind Rennova\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Cockpit, Lab, Trophy Room, Game Room, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover CAC caches, lore entries, upgrades, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cabin with cosmetics and trophies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds as you play. No separate campaign mode required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/3dfcf690cf52cbc7c2a08a2c43705cb2.avif?t=1770058654\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/85bda968a7c6e40bea9a57e5847341de.avif?t=1770058654\" width=891 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your MARBL stores holographic commanders, each tied to a faction with its own worldview. Level them in battle, unlock alternate Powers, and uncover memory fragments from Operators who came before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six factions inspired by Spiral Dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities, ultimates, and mastery tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARBL memory fragments that deepen the mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/669cd8eb5eb394a9a9f4874ffd202095.avif?t=1770058654\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/dc9e4c8a148f8a2d2f25e7e4b1fdd87d.avif?t=1770058654\" width=891 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the people running your ship:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TeeBee</strong> \u2013 your excitable navigator bot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hal</strong> \u2013 an anxious engineer who trusts machines more than people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliza</strong> \u2013 your pilot and quiet moral compass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ira</strong> \u2013 a hardened survivor turned scientist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jackpot</strong> \u2013 a reprogrammed casino bot with questionable wisdom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to them, unlock scenes, and explore personal arcs that evolve with your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/3ede5fa80c096dd5ac4bcd31eacac66a.poster.avif?t=1770058654\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/3ede5fa80c096dd5ac4bcd31eacac66a.webm?t=1770058654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/3ede5fa80c096dd5ac4bcd31eacac66a.mp4?t=1770058654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/1bc434af16cf0523821496f3f275e7c9.avif?t=1770058654\" width=897 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win duels to earn XP, CACs, cosmetics, mastery, and new ship progress. Your choices unlock Mechommanders, reveal MARBL memories, and open new narrative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play \u2192 Progress \u2192 Explore \u2192 Discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is the MARBL waking up now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does it remember you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the factions repeat their cycle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an Operator and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412340/extras/f7809beafad639c72676a6186638409b.avif?t=1770058654\" data-big-src=h